---
title:    "From Boolean Equalities to Constraints"
citation: "(LOPSTR 2015)"
url:      "http://www.informatik.uni-kiel.de/~mh/papers/LOPSTR15.html"
date:     2015-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
---
This paper describes an automatic method
to transform Boolean equalities into constraint equalities,
if possible.
With this transformation tool,
it is sufficient to use only Boolean equalities in Curry programs,
since operationally more efficient constraints are automatically inserted.